---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site-config";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="sr-only">
      Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}. I turn messy data into systems people can trust. As a BI & Application Developer Intern and M.Sc. AI student, I build machine learning pipelines and dashboards that run in production, where accuracy isn't optional. Based in Germany, open to full-time roles across the country. What I work with: Python & PyTorch, LangGraph & LiteLLM, FastAPI, AWS & Docker, SQL & Power BI. From agentic AI pipelines and EEG-based brain-computer interfaces to pharma analytics in a GxP-regulated environment, I build things that work outside the notebook.
    </p>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="text-sm font-light">
      <p class="text-sm font-light">
        Hi, I'm {SITE.author.firstName}. I turn messy data into systems people can trust. As a BI &amp; Application Developer Intern and M.Sc. AI student, I build machine learning pipelines and dashboards that run in production, where accuracy isn't optional. Based in Germany, open to full-time roles across the country.
      </p>
      <br />
      <strong>What I work with:</strong>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Python &amp; PyTorch</li>
        <li>LangGraph &amp; LiteLLM</li>
        <li>FastAPI</li>
        <li>AWS &amp; Docker</li>
        <li>SQL &amp; Power BI</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm font-light mt-2">
        From agentic AI pipelines and EEG-based brain-computer interfaces to pharma analytics in a GxP-regulated environment, I build things that work outside the notebook.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Card>
